<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ur">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Ghani Perfumes ✨</title>
<style>
body { font-family: sans-serif; margin: 0; padding: 0; background: #f9f6f0; color: #333; text-align: center; }
header { background: #1a1a1a; color: #d4af37; padding: 25px 10px; }
.logo { width: 70px; height: 70px; border-radius: 50%; background: #d4af37; color: #1a1a1a; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 26px; font-weight: bold; margin: 0 auto 10px auto; border: 2px solid #fff; }
header h1 { margin: 5px 0; font-size: 24px; }
header p { margin: 0; color: #ccc; font-size: 13px; }
.container { max-width: 90%; margin: 20px auto; padding: 10px; }
.card { background: #fff; border-radius: 10px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 15px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); border: 1px solid #e0d5c1; }
.card img { width: 100%; height: 180px; object-fit: cover; border-radius: 8px; }
.card h3 { margin: 10px 0 5px 0; color: #1a1a1a; }
.price { color: #b8860b; font-weight: bold; margin: 5px 0; }
.btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 8px; padding: 10px 18px; background: #25d366; color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 14px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
<div class="logo">GP</div>
<h1>Ghani Perfumes ✨</h1>
<p>Original & Long-Lasting Fragrances</p>
</header>

<div class="container">
<h2>Our Fragrance Collection</h2>

<div class="card">
<img src="royal-oud.png" alt="Royal Oud">
<h3>Royal Oud</h3>
<div class="price">Rs. 2,500</div>
<a href="https://wa.me/923276071128?text=Royal%20Oud" class="btn" target="_blank">WhatsApp Order</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="jannat-ul-firdous.png" alt="Jannat-ul-Firdous">
<h3>Jannat-ul-Firdous</h3>
<div class="price">Rs. 1,800</div>
<a href="https://wa.me/923276071128?text=Jannat%20ul%20Firdous" class="btn" target="_blank">WhatsApp Order</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<img src="velvet-musk.png" alt="Velvet Musk">
<h3>Velvet Musk</h3>
<div class="price">Rs. 2,200</div>
<a href="https://wa.me/923276071128?text=Velvet%20Musk" class="btn" target="_blank">WhatsApp Order</a>
</div>

</div>

